# Volocal fork

Full context: `AGENTS.md`. Trust review: `docs/SECURITY.md`.

- Keep audio, transcripts, and LLM tokens on-device. Hugging Face is weights-only (list/download GGUF and CoreML).
- LLM is llama.cpp GGUF only. No MLX / safetensors / ONNX.
- Do not add analytics, crash reporters, ads, or extra network SDKs.
- Bundle ID stays `com.localiosllm.volocal`. Do not restore the upstream Apple team.
- Barge-in: one `AVAudioEngine`, Voice Processing AEC, mic stays open during TTS. Install the input tap once; LiveContainer Multitask already holds a tap and a second `installTap` crashes (`nullptr == Tap()`). Keep LC Multitask off for this guest. Do not classify short barge-in as echo. End a turn on ~0.8s of quiet, not only Parakeet EOU. Drain cancelled TTS before the next llama decode. Start TTS on the first clause; llama.cpp and CoreML TTS take turns on `GPUExclusive`. Next-clause TTS synthesizes during playback. Disable the idle timer while listening/speaking. `llama_memory_clear(..., true)`. Overlay `446/6144` is a GPU/KV crash, not OOM.
- `project.yml` is the XcodeGen source of truth. FluidAudio is FluidInference **exact 0.15.8** (`ModelHub`, not `DownloadUtils`). llama.swift is **exact 2.10549.0**.
- No local Mac: ship IPAs via `.github/workflows/ios-ipa.yml` as a rolling GitHub Release (`sidestore` / `Volocal.ipa`). Do not compile iOS on Linux. Do not accumulate Actions artifact zips.
- Do not commit model weights, IPAs, or secrets.
- System prompt is user-editable (`volocal.customInstructions`) with a live token count. llama.cpp `n_ctx` is a 2K–128K log slider (`volocal.contextSize`, snap 512), not a free-form number. Long chats use a sliding window plus rolling recap, not an unbounded history. GGUF delete is in-app swipe; do not leave orphan huge files with no UI. Hidden reasoning is disabled in the prompt (`volocal.suppressThinking`): native Gemma 4 `<|turn>` template (never ChatML-fallback Gemma), Qwen 3 `/no_think`. Chat delimiters are stop sequences, not post-strip.
- Chatterbox Nano and Kokoro ANE crash or stall this iPhone. Do not add them back. TTS is PocketTTS (streaming default) or Supertonic-3 (newer CoreML, resampled 44.1→24 kHz). Do not split PocketTTS text every ~40 characters.
- A kill during `llama_model_load_from_file` must not crash-loop: persist `volocal.pendingLLMLoad` before load and skip auto-load on the next launch.
